        "label": "Type dictated text at the cursor",
        "job": "Put dictated text where the person's cursor is as one clipboard transaction (save, write, paste, restore, verify), never pasting over a clipboard it cannot put back, and note the dictation in their bounded history",
        "description": "Give text (cleaned by tool:dictate) and entry_id and context.app when known. Returns entry_id, kind (inserted-verified, inserted-unverified, blocked or failed) and saved, wrote, pasted, restored, verified and error.",
